WEBVTT

00:01.530 --> 00:04.939
His crush from his previous life...

00:05.740 --> 00:08.580
His sister from his previous life...

00:09.460 --> 00:12.820
And the people owing him
their lives will be here soon.

00:13.310 --> 00:17.130
He said I don't have
to tell them about myself,

00:17.680 --> 00:21.380
but if he cherishes those people, then I...

00:27.820 --> 00:29.120
We're already here?

00:29.120 --> 00:29.680
Yes.

00:29.680 --> 00:30.470
Yeah.

00:30.470 --> 00:32.240
It was so instant...

00:32.810 --> 00:35.310
Instant teleportation is awesome!

00:35.310 --> 00:37.310
I guess.

00:37.630 --> 00:39.310
What a beautiful place...

00:40.130 --> 00:42.340
Bro!

00:43.290 --> 00:44.320
Whoa!

00:44.320 --> 00:45.980
Welcome home!

00:45.980 --> 00:47.900
I'm back.

00:50.420 --> 00:52.640
Wow...

00:52.640 --> 00:54.910
So a beastman does exist!

00:56.720 --> 01:00.040
Welcome to the Spirits' village.

01:00.710 --> 01:02.050
Lady Aishia.

01:02.540 --> 01:04.180
It has been a while.

01:04.180 --> 01:06.540
It's an honour to see you again.

01:06.540 --> 01:07.920
It is.

01:08.380 --> 01:11.710
Is Sis Aishia actually a VIP?

01:11.710 --> 01:15.140
The Spirit village holds high-ranked spirits
who can materialise...

01:15.140 --> 01:19.010
...in human form to be sacred and revered.

01:19.010 --> 01:22.400
So we can't just call her Aishia...

01:22.400 --> 01:24.460
I'm sorry.

01:24.460 --> 01:27.150
I hate formalities, anyway.

01:28.390 --> 01:31.350
Nice to meet you.
I'm Celia Clare.

01:31.350 --> 01:33.320
I've heard about you from Rio.

01:33.320 --> 01:35.630
So you must be his sister.

01:35.630 --> 01:37.330
Y-Yes.

01:38.830 --> 01:42.020
Um, this might be so sudden,

01:42.020 --> 01:46.750
but can I touch your
beautiful tail just for a bit?

01:46.750 --> 01:49.510
Huh? O-Okay.

01:49.510 --> 01:52.470
Wow, so fluffy...

01:52.470 --> 01:54.390
I guess she likes fluffy stuff?

01:54.390 --> 01:55.900
I bet she does.

01:55.900 --> 01:57.260
Celia...

01:58.810 --> 02:00.770
Then, this might be paradise!

02:00.770 --> 02:01.680
Huh?

02:02.190 --> 02:03.410
Did she just...

02:03.410 --> 02:06.520
...speak Japanese to us?

02:06.520 --> 02:09.780
Yes! I'm also like my brother.

02:10.220 --> 02:12.640
I have memories from my previous life,

02:13.100 --> 02:14.480
so I...

02:15.010 --> 02:18.380
I want to be a candidate
as your Strahl language teacher!

02:19.100 --> 02:20.980
Are you sure, Latifa?

02:20.980 --> 02:22.870
Yeah, that's what I've decided.

02:23.300 --> 02:27.130
I've also told the others,
including the elders.

02:28.130 --> 02:32.830
I know what it feels like
to end up in a strange world.

02:38.430 --> 02:41.780
Also, I'm your sister.

02:42.510 --> 02:44.820
I want to be of help to you.

02:45.470 --> 02:49.400
All right, I get it.
Thanks, Latifa.

02:49.700 --> 02:50.740
I'm so happy.

02:53.170 --> 02:55.650
Apologies for the late introduction.

02:55.650 --> 03:00.250
Alongside Latifa, in order for you all to
get used to life in the village quickly,

03:00.250 --> 03:02.040
we'd like to help with this.

03:02.040 --> 03:03.890
My name is Sara.

03:03.890 --> 03:05.260
I'm Orphia.

03:05.260 --> 03:06.540
Alma here.

03:06.880 --> 03:08.490
Nice to meet you.

03:08.490 --> 03:12.740
Oh, I'm Aki Sendo,
and this is my brother.

03:13.460 --> 03:14.800
I'm Masato.

03:15.310 --> 03:19.300
I'm Miharu Ayase.
Pleasure to meet you.

03:19.730 --> 03:21.350
So she's...

03:21.780 --> 03:24.170
...my brother's crush...

03:38.820 --> 03:44.540
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

04:44.750 --> 04:46.580
This is soothing...

04:46.580 --> 04:48.230
That tickles!

04:48.860 --> 04:52.070
This is the best...

04:55.320 --> 04:56.110
WELCOME HOME

04:56.110 --> 04:59.660
Well, then, all the villagers
are waiting for you,

04:59.660 --> 05:01.130
so I'll take you to them.

05:07.700 --> 05:10.920
Could it be that they...

05:11.440 --> 05:13.170
...are afraid of us?

05:14.910 --> 05:17.310
You have a scary face, after all.

05:17.310 --> 05:18.420
How come?

05:18.790 --> 05:20.510
You siblings are on great terms, I see.

05:20.510 --> 05:21.470
No way!

05:21.470 --> 05:23.430
See, you're so in sync!

05:25.340 --> 05:29.180
This village is quite
estranged to humans.

05:29.180 --> 05:31.560
I think it's rare for them to see one.

05:39.210 --> 05:40.610
Hello.

05:41.020 --> 05:41.840
Uh...

05:41.840 --> 05:43.020
What's up?

05:47.520 --> 05:49.710
Looks like she's never seen your uniform.

05:49.710 --> 05:50.450
Huh?

05:51.120 --> 05:52.620
Does it look weird?

05:52.620 --> 05:57.710
We're about to meet the elders,
so I thought I should dress formally...

05:57.710 --> 06:00.130
It's not weird.

06:00.130 --> 06:02.490
She thinks it's cute!

06:02.490 --> 06:04.890
That's great to hear.

06:05.230 --> 06:07.600
I also like your ears.

06:07.970 --> 06:09.650
They're so cute.

06:30.800 --> 06:33.630
Um, so...

06:33.630 --> 06:37.520
Can I call you Sis Miharu?

06:37.520 --> 06:38.540
Of course.

06:38.890 --> 06:41.670
Can I call you Latifa too?

06:42.780 --> 06:47.050
Yeah! Tell me a lot about you from now on!

06:47.050 --> 06:48.330
Gladly!

06:48.330 --> 06:51.110
Mind if I join in as well?

06:51.110 --> 06:52.240
Me too!

06:53.120 --> 06:54.060
Of course!

06:54.900 --> 06:56.810
Let's get along well together!

06:58.530 --> 07:01.390
Whoa! This is a feast!

07:01.390 --> 07:04.970
Masato, don't get too excited,
it's embarrassing.

07:04.970 --> 07:09.160
It's a welcome party,
so there's no need for formalities.

07:13.160 --> 07:15.920
I didn't think they'd prepare
a welcoming committee for us.

07:15.920 --> 07:17.390
How delightful.

07:17.390 --> 07:20.490
Not to mention,
there's a lot of fluffy people...

07:20.490 --> 07:22.610
Celia, you keep talking about that...

07:22.610 --> 07:25.550
I've learned another side of you today.

07:26.260 --> 07:31.510
Lady Aishia, we Spirit people
are most glad to see you again.

07:31.510 --> 07:33.290
Welcome back.

07:35.220 --> 07:38.270
Also, the children from another world,
and Celia.

07:38.270 --> 07:41.270
Welcome to the Spirit village.

07:42.510 --> 07:47.260
You may be otherworldly,
but you really look just like humans.

07:47.260 --> 07:50.940
Don't stare at them
with such a stern look.

07:50.940 --> 07:53.540
Our guests are getting scared.

07:58.140 --> 08:00.790
It's been a while, Aishia, Rio.

08:00.790 --> 08:01.750
Yeah.

08:01.750 --> 08:03.170
Lady Dryas...

08:03.510 --> 08:04.180
Whoa...

08:04.180 --> 08:05.050
Amazing!

08:06.030 --> 08:07.810
Lady Dryas!

08:07.810 --> 08:09.180
It's really her!

08:09.180 --> 08:13.060
Well, then, to celebrate our new encounter...

08:13.060 --> 08:14.100
Let's have a toast.

08:14.100 --> 08:15.560
Cheers!

08:15.560 --> 08:17.730
All right, time to drink
and scream our lungs out!

08:17.730 --> 08:18.520
Yay!

08:23.770 --> 08:26.240
I'm so happy! Thanks!

08:26.240 --> 08:29.050
The otherworldly people's od
is something else.

08:29.050 --> 08:30.390
That looks tasty...

08:30.390 --> 08:31.490
It does.

08:31.490 --> 08:32.370
Huh?

08:32.710 --> 08:34.240
Sis Aki.

08:34.240 --> 08:35.850
There's inari sushi here.

08:35.850 --> 08:38.370
Quit with the joking...

08:38.700 --> 08:39.830
There really is!

08:40.230 --> 08:41.880
I made it!

08:42.260 --> 08:46.060
I thought it'd be nostalgic for you.
Feel free to have a bite.

08:46.060 --> 08:47.130
Yeah!

08:47.130 --> 08:48.900
Thanks for the food!

08:50.590 --> 08:52.090
So good!

08:52.500 --> 08:54.340
Glad to hear that!

09:00.560 --> 09:04.980
Haruto is really liked
by everyone for his kindness...

09:04.980 --> 09:06.640
He really is a good brother.

09:06.640 --> 09:09.680
That's right!
He's my pride of a brother!

09:10.370 --> 09:11.740
I envy you...

09:12.110 --> 09:12.770
Huh?

09:13.300 --> 09:16.160
I want to meet my brother soon.

09:16.940 --> 09:19.140
Where could he be right now?

09:19.140 --> 09:21.030
I want to find him...

09:21.500 --> 09:25.860
I want to be able to speak
the local language quickly.

09:26.550 --> 09:28.110
I'll do my best learning it.

09:28.690 --> 09:29.510
Sure.

09:34.310 --> 09:36.100
We're here.

09:36.100 --> 09:39.020
This will be your home from now on.

09:39.020 --> 09:39.950
Whoa!

09:39.950 --> 09:41.010
So big!

09:41.010 --> 09:42.060
So pretty!

09:42.060 --> 09:43.270
How beautiful.

09:43.600 --> 09:45.900
As for you three...

09:45.900 --> 09:48.000
Feel free to use this room.

09:48.000 --> 09:48.950
Wow!

09:48.950 --> 09:50.150
Thanks.

09:50.560 --> 09:53.110
I'm sure you all must be tired,

09:53.110 --> 09:55.380
so why don't you jump
in the open air bath?

09:55.380 --> 09:57.660
Feel free to get some rest.

09:58.190 --> 09:59.140
That's what they said.

09:59.140 --> 10:02.040
Open air bath? Sweet!

10:03.040 --> 10:05.950
This is the best...

10:07.250 --> 10:09.340
This is soothing.

10:09.340 --> 10:10.970
That tickles!

10:19.610 --> 10:20.500
Tch...

10:21.200 --> 10:23.710
Why did I lose...

10:24.220 --> 10:26.080
Rock, paper, scissors!

10:27.120 --> 10:28.650
I won!

10:29.070 --> 10:31.280
We'll go on first, then.

10:31.280 --> 10:33.930
Had I asked you for help,

10:33.930 --> 10:36.180
I would've won...

10:36.180 --> 10:37.280
I wonder.

10:38.100 --> 10:39.450
Want to try?

10:39.840 --> 10:41.660
Rock, paper, scissors!

10:46.040 --> 10:48.030
I can see the stars.

10:48.030 --> 10:50.050
You're right. It's so amazing.

10:50.970 --> 10:54.710
We really have come
to an extraordinary place.

10:57.230 --> 11:00.330
Can we go back... someday?

11:01.360 --> 11:02.060
Yeah.

11:02.390 --> 11:04.860
I'm sure, one day...

11:10.870 --> 11:13.820
Why are you so strong, Bro?

11:13.820 --> 11:14.420
Huh?

11:15.220 --> 11:18.800
I mean, you always look
so strong in every battle.

11:18.800 --> 11:20.330
Why's that?

11:20.680 --> 11:23.390
That's not true.
It's just...

11:26.690 --> 11:28.850
I have something I must do.

11:29.550 --> 11:31.490
Something you must do?

11:32.020 --> 11:32.780
Yeah.

11:33.200 --> 11:35.690
For that, I just have to become stronger.

11:39.010 --> 11:40.470
I want to become stronger too.

11:42.010 --> 11:46.080
I want to become stronger
and protect the girls!

11:47.110 --> 11:48.430
I see.

11:49.660 --> 11:53.010
Bro! We're done bathing!

11:53.010 --> 11:54.030
Let's go.

11:54.030 --> 11:54.740
Okay.

12:00.740 --> 12:04.080
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

12:20.140 --> 12:22.730
Master, good morning.

12:22.730 --> 12:23.670
Rio...

12:24.180 --> 12:25.140
Morning.

12:25.510 --> 12:26.780
You're up early.

12:26.780 --> 12:27.970
Yes.

12:27.970 --> 12:31.610
This place has the freshest air, it feels great.

12:32.410 --> 12:35.070
Thanks to that, I could get up early
and be so refreshed.

12:35.070 --> 12:36.400
Is that so?

12:36.400 --> 12:37.570
Master.

12:37.890 --> 12:39.340
I'm really sorry.

12:42.060 --> 12:44.080
I've kept you waiting for so long.

12:44.500 --> 12:47.120
Thanks to Latifa and the others,

12:47.120 --> 12:49.620
Miharu and the siblings
could get used to life here...

12:49.620 --> 12:52.580
...more quickly than I had predicted, so...

12:53.090 --> 12:56.490
Let's send a letter to your parents now.

12:57.670 --> 12:59.840
Thank you, but...

12:59.840 --> 13:01.460
Aren't you forcing yourself?

13:01.460 --> 13:03.500
What do you mean?

13:03.500 --> 13:06.630
I know that you're doing your best...

13:06.630 --> 13:11.310
...to get them back to their original world.

13:11.310 --> 13:13.860
I also want to support you for that.

13:13.860 --> 13:14.860
But...

13:15.180 --> 13:16.880
What about you?

13:16.880 --> 13:18.270
Me?

13:18.730 --> 13:22.610
You said you could build
a grave for your parents,

13:23.010 --> 13:25.040
but there's still something else...

13:25.040 --> 13:28.980
Like, um... with you saving me,

13:28.980 --> 13:32.620
am I getting in the way
of something you wanted to do?

13:33.750 --> 13:35.760
That's why you shouldn't
worry about me...

13:36.240 --> 13:38.560
Thank you for your concern.

13:38.560 --> 13:43.140
Sure, there's something I have to do, but...

13:43.570 --> 13:45.630
You're not in my way at all.

13:46.380 --> 13:47.930
Back then...

13:50.600 --> 13:53.940
I really wanted to save you
more than anything.

13:54.350 --> 13:55.840
Rio...

13:55.840 --> 13:58.110
That goes the same with
returning those three.

13:58.660 --> 14:00.600
That's why when we send the letter,

14:00.600 --> 14:03.500
I mean for us to gather
some info on the heroes,

14:03.500 --> 14:05.520
and head to Rodania.

14:06.870 --> 14:10.370
All right.
Thanks for telling me.

14:10.810 --> 14:15.330
If there's anything I can help,
feel free to ask.

14:15.710 --> 14:21.730
After all, I'm the magician with
the most mana in the entire Beltrum!

14:21.730 --> 14:22.940
That's amazing.

14:22.940 --> 14:24.470
You don't believe me, do you?

14:24.470 --> 14:25.800
I do!

14:28.700 --> 14:30.680
No matter what happens,

14:30.680 --> 14:32.690
I'm always on your side.

14:44.280 --> 14:48.910
Bro, Sis Celia, Sis Aishia.

14:49.310 --> 14:50.610
Have a safe trip!

14:50.610 --> 14:51.300
Yeah.

14:51.300 --> 14:52.450
We're off now.

14:52.450 --> 14:53.160
Yeah.

14:53.450 --> 14:55.330
Leave everything here to us!

14:55.330 --> 14:56.310
Thanks.

14:57.150 --> 14:59.750
No need to worry about us.

14:59.750 --> 15:03.540
Also, it seems like Miharu
wants to give you something.

15:04.500 --> 15:06.180
Um...

15:06.750 --> 15:11.120
I made you lunch,
so feel free to eat it.

15:11.460 --> 15:13.140
Thank you.

15:14.030 --> 15:16.950
You were up so early,
so this must be hard.

15:16.950 --> 15:17.930
Not at all.

15:18.330 --> 15:22.270
We've always left ourselves to you.

15:22.270 --> 15:26.610
And you're also heading back
to Strahl for us...

15:27.180 --> 15:30.740
This is the only thing
I can do for you...

15:31.310 --> 15:33.060
Don't worry about it.

15:33.410 --> 15:35.870
I'm doing this because I want to.

15:36.460 --> 15:38.130
Thank you.

15:38.130 --> 15:42.100
I'll definitely return the favour someday.

15:42.450 --> 15:44.480
This lunch is more than enough.

15:44.880 --> 15:46.130
I'll make sure to eat it.

15:46.130 --> 15:48.420
I hope it suits your taste.

15:48.420 --> 15:52.260
It's okay.
I love your cooking, after all.

15:54.180 --> 15:57.700
Miharu worked hard making that.

15:57.700 --> 16:01.150
She looks like a proper wife!

16:01.590 --> 16:03.900
Until you're back,

16:03.900 --> 16:06.470
I'll work hard here!

16:06.470 --> 16:07.330
Sure.

16:11.980 --> 16:14.070
We're off, then.

16:14.070 --> 16:15.990
Let's go, Master Celia,

16:15.990 --> 16:17.120
Aishia.

16:21.430 --> 16:23.970
Safe trip!

16:24.970 --> 16:28.030
I pray for their safety...

16:33.230 --> 16:36.230
All right, until they're back,

16:36.930 --> 16:40.740
let's surprise them with Strahl language!

16:41.100 --> 16:42.590
We'll start our class now!

16:42.590 --> 16:43.730
Yeah!

16:43.980 --> 16:45.840
BELTRUM KINGDOM, RODANIA TERRITORY,

16:45.840 --> 16:47.350
BELONGING TO MARQUESS RODAN
Without further ado,

16:47.350 --> 16:53.490
we'd like for you, Master Hiroaki Sakata,
a fellow Hero, to attend the evening party...

16:54.010 --> 16:58.250
I am here on behalf of the King
to deliver this invitation.

16:58.250 --> 17:01.650
Of course, this also extends to
Princess Flora, Duke Huguenot,

17:01.650 --> 17:04.000
and also Lady Roanna.

17:04.000 --> 17:06.609
I'd love to attend the party,

17:06.609 --> 17:10.890
but it's all up to Master Hiroaki's will.

17:11.290 --> 17:14.010
We still have time until the evening party.

17:14.400 --> 17:17.270
I don't mean to have you rush the answer.

17:18.099 --> 17:20.270
Please think about this carefully.

17:20.270 --> 17:23.520
Even her voice is so cute...

17:24.079 --> 17:26.540
Flora and Roanna
are some high level stuff,

17:26.540 --> 17:30.340
but the plot with the duchess
of another country really takes the cake.

17:31.030 --> 17:34.170
Man, we've got ourselves
a star performer here, for real!

17:35.570 --> 17:38.480
Um, Master Hiroaki?

17:41.290 --> 17:43.900
So it's a party to announce the hero there?

17:44.270 --> 17:46.800
Very well, I'll attend it.

17:47.190 --> 17:49.270
You're coming as well, right, Liselotte?

17:49.270 --> 17:50.960
I mean to, yes.

17:50.960 --> 17:54.050
Then it's settled.
I'm attending it.

17:55.380 --> 17:58.560
I'm sure His Majesty will be happy.

17:58.560 --> 18:00.310
On the night of the party,

18:00.310 --> 18:02.810
I can't wait to see the Hero's face...

18:02.810 --> 18:05.010
I'm looking forward to it.

18:08.740 --> 18:11.190
Haruto, we're at Creia.

18:11.190 --> 18:11.860
Yeah.

18:14.110 --> 18:15.890
BELTRUM KINGDOM, CREIA TERRITORY,
So this is your homeland...

18:15.890 --> 18:17.870
BELONGING TO COUNT CLAIRE
So this is your homeland...

18:17.870 --> 18:20.620
Yes, and that house...

18:21.360 --> 18:23.660
...is where I grew up.

18:24.120 --> 18:28.310
There's a hidden passage
in the garden leading to the manor.

18:28.310 --> 18:30.880
Only my family knows about it.

18:30.880 --> 18:33.780
I think we can deliver
the letter through there.

18:38.610 --> 18:40.250
Can we make it from here?

18:40.250 --> 18:41.100
Yes.

18:41.590 --> 18:42.510
It's over there.

18:43.300 --> 18:45.460
There's risks of us being spotted,

18:46.510 --> 18:49.680
so I'll use a spirit technique to hide us.

18:49.680 --> 18:52.110
I'll use the spirit technique.

18:52.110 --> 18:53.650
Excuse me.

19:00.720 --> 19:03.370
Master, before the guard comes back,

19:03.370 --> 19:05.680
please release the entrance's lock.

19:05.680 --> 19:06.910
Leave it to me.

19:07.810 --> 19:08.840
There it is.

19:09.360 --> 19:10.560
I'll help.

19:10.560 --> 19:11.800
Thanks.

19:28.030 --> 19:29.650
We've been found.

19:29.650 --> 19:30.790
Let's hurry.

19:30.790 --> 19:31.490
Yes.

19:34.950 --> 19:36.490
What's the meaning of this?

19:36.890 --> 19:39.750
There's no way an outsider
would be able to come here.

19:42.800 --> 19:43.670
Master.

19:47.920 --> 19:49.710
Is it you, Celia?

19:50.560 --> 19:51.980
Are you Celia?

19:55.970 --> 19:58.730
Dear Father and Mother,

19:59.430 --> 20:00.470
it is me, Celia.

20:01.340 --> 20:04.930
I am sorry for making you worry.

20:05.310 --> 20:07.250
But please do not worry.

20:07.690 --> 20:11.290
I can now live safely and peacefully...

20:11.290 --> 20:14.940
...with people I trust.

20:15.660 --> 20:20.450
I may be a disobedient daughter for
abandoning my marriage with the Arbor family,

20:21.050 --> 20:23.150
but I really wanted to convey this.

20:24.050 --> 20:27.370
However, I will surely see you again.

20:27.370 --> 20:30.000
I will explain everything to you
when that happens.

20:30.790 --> 20:31.910
Until then...

20:32.410 --> 20:36.210
Please take care of yourself.

20:37.200 --> 20:40.180
With thanks for the love and kindness,

20:40.180 --> 20:41.940
you always give me,

20:42.560 --> 20:44.050
Celia Claire.

20:45.740 --> 20:48.390
Celia! Celia!

20:48.790 --> 20:50.100
Celia!

20:50.100 --> 20:52.790
Count Roland!
What's going on?

20:52.790 --> 20:53.630
No...

20:54.110 --> 20:55.360
It's nothing.

20:56.310 --> 20:58.350
You're no disobedient daughter of mine.

20:58.830 --> 21:02.770
Let's meet again, Celia.
Promise me.

21:03.820 --> 21:05.790
Are you sure you don't
want to meet them?

21:06.230 --> 21:07.200
Yes.

21:07.710 --> 21:10.330
This is fine.

21:10.670 --> 21:11.740
All right.

21:12.470 --> 21:14.700
Thank you, Rio.

21:15.210 --> 21:16.850
Let's go see them again.

21:17.250 --> 21:19.190
Face to face, next time.

21:19.910 --> 21:21.170
I'm sure you can someday.

21:21.540 --> 21:22.230
Yeah.

21:23.030 --> 21:25.060
Yeah, I guess.

21:25.700 --> 21:27.510
We're off to Rodania next, then.

21:27.970 --> 21:28.780
Right we are.

23:03.700 --> 23:07.820
Lady Liselotte, we're almost at Amande.

23:07.820 --> 23:09.780
Thanks, Aria.

23:14.750 --> 23:15.710
What's going on?

23:15.710 --> 23:17.700
We'll investigate right away.

23:17.700 --> 23:19.820
Natalie, Cosette!

23:20.220 --> 23:21.730
Lady Liselotte!

23:21.730 --> 23:23.760
Chloe! What's happening?!

23:23.760 --> 23:25.190
It's a dragon!

23:25.190 --> 23:27.180
A black dragon is coming!

23:27.180 --> 23:28.340
A dragon?

23:28.340 --> 23:32.930
We're going to perform
an emergency landing on the nearest city!

